msgid "<0>SCRIE</0> and <1>DRIE</1> are NYC Rent Freeze programs that can protect eligible tenants from future rent increases."
msgstr "<0>SCRIE</0> and <1>DRIE</1> are NYC Rent Freeze programs that can protect eligible tenants from future rent increases."

#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/AssertYourRights/content/AyrScrieDrieContent.tsx:13
