#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/AssertYourRights/content/AyrRentReductionCheckContent.tsx:25
msgid "A rent reduction order is issued by the Division of Housing and Community Renewal (DHCR) when an owner has failed to provide required or essential services. A rent reduction order can require the landlord to reduce the legal rent because required services were not being provided. A rent reduction order remains in effect until DHCR issues an order restoring the rent."
msgstr "A rent reduction order is issued by the Division of Housing and Community Renewal (DHCR) when an owner has failed to provide required or essential services. A rent reduction order can require the landlord to reduce the legal rent because required services were not being provided. A rent reduction order remains in effect until DHCR issues an order restoring the rent."

